 "description": "Use this when the user wants a short launch video for their own product page, such as \"make a launch video from https://example.com/\". Pass the page address. Returns a complete, self-contained HTML page with an animated CSS clip of about 12 seconds (name, headline, description, up to three headings, call to action), its scenes, and the source and as_of date. It reads the one public page, honouring robots.txt, copies no images and runs no scripts. It does not render a video file.",
